{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Learned mounts take their speed from riding skill and fly only where flying is allowed",
  "contract": [
    "Risen Nightmarish Steed 900055 is a learned mount whose client spell carries a 100% ground aura and a 280%",
    "flying aura with no area limit, so it used to fly anywhere at any riding skill.",
    "Every mount follows the rider's riding skill: Novice 50 gives 40% ground speed, Apprentice 75 gives 60%, and",
    "Journeyman 150 and above give 100%. Flying needs Expert 225 (150%) or Artisan 300 (280%) and an area where",
    "flying is allowed, such as Outland; Orgrimmar allows none at any skill.",
    "Socketless sessions never acknowledge flight, so the test counts the server's SMSG_MOVE_SET_CAN_FLY and",
    "SMSG_MOVE_UNSET_CAN_FLY packets, not client flight or rendered tooltips."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 90000,
